bloop-plugin-wavetable is a Rust port of SocaLabs Wavetable and of the Gin
library it is built on, both by Roland Rabien, of the Airwindows effects and
the pink noise Wavetable carries, and it bundles wavetables and factory
presets that came with Wavetable. Each part keeps its own licence; every one
of them is permissive. The full texts follow.

