================================================================================
Wavetables and presets
================================================================================

wavetables/Adventure Kid: made from the Adventure Kid Waveforms (AKWF) by
Kristoffer Ekstrand, released into the public domain under CC0 1.0.

wavetables/Neu KatalYst: their author's readme, shipped with Wavetable:
"Enjoy! And feel free to use them in all your other synths, including Serum,
Vital, Surge, Phase Plant, Dune, Pigments, Sektor, Union, etc - no credit
necessary, but always welcome."

wavetables/Presets: two tables Flamedragonz recorded ("Recorded on 16.05.2020
in Edison") inside the preset that plays them, one of Wavetable's factory
presets, distributed under Wavetable's licence above.

The factory presets in src/presets_data.rs come from Wavetable's repository,
under its licence above.
